  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The combined original price for a mirror and a vase is <math alttext=\"dollar sign 60\"><mo>$</mo><mn>60</mn></math>. After a <math alttext=\"25 percent sign\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math> discount to the mirror and a <math alttext=\"45 percent sign\"><mn>45</mn><mo>%</mo></math> discount to the vase are applied, the combined sale price for the two items is <math alttext=\"dollar sign 39\"><mo>$</mo><mn>39</mn></math>. Which system of equations gives the original price <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math>, in dollars, of the mirror and the original price <math alttext=\"v\"><mi>v</mi>\n</math>, in dollars, of the vase?</p>",
